            <div xml:id="d177">

                <pb facs="0363" n="259" xml:id="pg259"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">862.00/3061: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Germany (Dodd) to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-08-23T11:00:00+01:00">August 23, 1933—11
                            a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received August 23—7:30 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>133. Your 101, August 20, 7 p.m. I yesterday declined the invitation on the
                    ground that I could not absent myself from Berlin long enough to have the
                    pleasure of accepting and I understand that the French and British will not go
                    to Nuremberg.</p>
                <p>Copy of my note sent by mail.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dodd</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
